{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-single-project-tsx","path":"/projects/bai-ft-justin-timberlake","result":{"data":{"project":{"Completed":"7 years ago","dateCompleted":"2019-03-31","Title":"Bai Ft. Justin Timberlake","RepoLink":null,"LiveLink":"https://youtu.be/xqWZgkGe0AQ","skills":[],"Narrative":{"data":{"childMarkdownRemark":{"html":"<p>This was a lesson in just how much work goes into a national broadcast spot.  BlackMath contacted a few composers to write 3-5 songs for the commercial and told us that the Bai people would be choosing the best fit.  About 80% through the writing the process we found out that <strong>Justin Timberlake</strong> himself would be choosing the final track!</p>\n<p>After we locked the track, I was basically making edits around the clock.  There was a point where edits where basically coming in as fast as I was making them.  What I learned from this project is that keeping <em>very</em> organized files and versions.  It was a blast and of course, now I can say I wrote a track for JT.</p>"}}},"tags":[{"tagName":"project"}],"Cover":{"alternativeText":"bai.png","localFile":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/sigman-public-assets/bai_5e5377f6cd/bai_5e5377f6cd.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fullWidth","backgroundColor":"#f85868","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/d5305/bai_5e5377f6cd.png","srcSet":"/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/d5305/bai_5e5377f6cd.png 660w","sizes":"100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/523de/bai_5e5377f6cd.webp 660w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"100vw"}]},"width":1,"height":0.6757575757575758},"fixed":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","width":400,"height":270,"src":"/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/497c6/bai_5e5377f6cd.png","srcSet":"/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/497c6/bai_5e5377f6cd.png 1x,\n/static/53e8698fd4f52134e4f7a7eee8169a5b/2a4de/bai_5e5377f6cd.png 1.5x"}}}},"Gallery":[{"local